<title>USA: Hospital Staffing says may sell some assets.</title>
<headline>Hospital Staffing says may sell some assets.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospital Staffing Services Inc said Tuesday it is considering selling some of its assets and business units, including certain Medicare certified home care offices.</p>
<p>Hospital Staffing said, however, that it would consider selling some of its Medicare businesses only if it can concurrently sign agreements to manage the new operations.</p>
<p>The company said it would use sale proceeds to expand its remaining operations and buy higher margin businesses.</p>
<p>It said it is also exploring ventures using third party financing.</p>
</text>
